# Mintlify automatically ignores these files and directories:
# .git, .github, .claude, .agents, .idea, node_modules,
# README.md, LICENSE.md, CHANGELOG.md, CONTRIBUTING.md

# Draft content
drafts/
*.draft.mdx

# Unlisted draft trees. Dropping a page from docs.json is not enough: Mintlify
# still builds an unlisted page, so it stays reachable by URL and in search.
